          ["with", 1230.4778749999998, 1230.557875],
          ["what", 1230.637875, 1230.797875],
          ["result", 1230.797875, 1231.277875],
          ["And", 1231.5100416666667, 1231.5900416666666],
          ["the", 1231.5900416666666, 1231.7500416666667],
          ["options", 1231.7500416666667, 1232.1500416666665],
          ["their", 1232.1500416666665, 1232.3100416666666],
          ["costs", 1232.3100416666666, 1232.7900416666666],
          ["your", 1232.8700416666666, 1233.0300416666666],
          ["recommendation", 1233.0300416666666, 1233.7500416666667],
          ["and", 1233.7500416666667, 1233.8300416666666],
          ["who", 1233.8300416666666, 1233.9900416666667],
          ["must", 1233.9900416666667, 1234.2300416666667],
          ["decide", 1234.2300416666667, 1234.5500416666666],
          ["by", 1234.5500416666666, 1234.6300416666666],
          ["when", 1234.6300416666666, 1235.0300416666666]
        ]
      }
    ],
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 441.90056250000004,
        "end": 444.03295833333334,
        "text": "With the problem framed, we turn to data. ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 444.03295833333334,
        "end": 447.67895833333336,
        "text": "Data earns trust only after it is qualified for a specific use. ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 447.67895833333336,
        "end": 449.9190416666667,
        "text": "A file that opens, a chart that looks right, ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 449.9190416666667,
        "end": 453.0703125,
        "text": "a promising model signal: none of them alone establishes meaning, ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 453.0703125,
        "end": 455.57887500000004,
        "text": "quality, permission, or reproducibility. ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 455.57887500000004,
        "end": 457.1811875,
        "text": "So ask six questions. ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 457.1811875,
        "end": 458.35770833333333,
        "text": "Where did it come from? ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 458.35770833333333,
        "end": 459.46245833333336,
        "text": "When was it knowable? ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 459.46245833333336,
        "end": 460.4216666666667,
        "text": "What does it mean? ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 460.4216666666667,
        "end": 461.3508541666667,
        "text": "What changed it? ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 461.3508541666667,
        "end": 462.3508541666667,
        "text": "How good is it? ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 462.3508541666667,
        "end": 464.05606250000005,
        "text": "And how may it be used? ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 464.05606250000005,
        "end": 466.05606250000005,
        "text": "Data that cannot answer them may be explored ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 466.05606250000005,
        "end": 468.46977083333337,
        "text": "within its authorized scope, but stays out of shared, ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 468.46977083333337,
        "end": 470.7694583333334,
        "text": "production and decision work until qualified. ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 470.7694583333334,
        "end": 473.66325,
        "text": "Reports, catalogs, cached copies and Agent summaries ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 473.66325,
        "end": 475.05870833333336,
        "text": "are secondary sources. ",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 475.05870833333336,
        "end": 477.4910916666667,
        "text": "None may quietly become the source of truth.",
        "segment": "09"
      },
      {
        "start": 1173.6034375,
        "end": 1177.1394166666666,
        "text": "Writing aims for fidelity, clarity and elegance, in that order. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1177.1394166666666,
        "end": 1179.8651874999998,
        "text": "Fidelity preserves the meaning: actors, conditions, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1179.8651874999998,
        "end": 1181.9288958333332,
        "text": "responsibilities and limits stay intact, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1181.9288958333332,
        "end": 1184.2529583333333,
        "text": "facts keep their sources, and counterexamples, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1184.2529583333333,
        "end": 1186.1561666666666,
        "text": "uncertainty and failure stay visible. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1186.1561666666666,
        "end": 1188.2397291666666,
        "text": "Clarity begins with accurate understanding, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1188.2397291666666,
        "end": 1189.6797291666667,
        "text": "then puts it plainly and fluently, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1189.6797291666667,
        "end": 1191.5492291666667,
        "text": "so the reader can understand and act. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1191.5492291666667,
        "end": 1193.9492291666666,
        "text": "Elegance brings taste and aesthetic judgment to rhythm, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1193.9492291666666,
        "end": 1196.985125,
        "text": "transitions and form, with precise verbs and concrete nouns, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1196.985125,
        "end": 1199.3943749999999,
        "text": "without slogans or pretended depth. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1199.3943749999999,
        "end": 1200.9143749999998,
        "text": "If collection ran two hours late, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1200.9143749999998,
        "end": 1203.4597291666666,
        "text": "write two hours late, not “roughly on time”. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1203.4597291666666,
        "end": 1204.4918541666666,
        "text": "That is fidelity. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1204.4918541666666,
        "end": 1206.6678958333332,
        "text": "Lead with the conclusion and the decision needed, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1206.6678958333332,
        "end": 1207.6528958333333,
        "text": "then the detail. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1207.6528958333333,
        "end": 1208.9525833333332,
        "text": "That is clarity. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1208.9525833333332,
        "end": 1210.6869791666666,
        "text": "Clarity has concrete checks: ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1210.6869791666666,
        "end": 1212.8803958333333,
        "text": "a title that names the subject and purpose; ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1212.8803958333333,
        "end": 1214.1528958333333,
        "text": "the conclusion first; ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1214.1528958333333,
        "end": 1215.5757916666666,
        "text": "one point per paragraph; ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1215.5757916666666,
        "end": 1217.6446041666666,
        "text": "important terms defined at first use. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1217.6446041666666,
        "end": 1219.9646041666665,
        "text": "Before sending, ask whether a reader outside the work ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1219.9646041666665,
        "end": 1223.6575416666665,
        "text": "could restate the conclusion, basis, limits and next action. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1223.6575416666665,
        "end": 1225.6600416666668,
        "text": "Escalating a risk takes four parts. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1225.6600416666668,
        "end": 1226.4800208333334,
        "text": "The risk. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1226.4800208333334,
        "end": 1229.1978749999998,
        "text": "The facts, impact, and the latest safe time to decide. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1229.1978749999998,
        "end": 1231.5100416666667,
        "text": "What containment was tried, and with what result. ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1231.5100416666667,
        "end": 1232.8700416666666,
        "text": "And the options, their costs, ",
        "segment": "25"
      },
      {
        "start": 1232.8700416666666,
        "end": 1236.2531083333333,
        "text": "your recommendation, and who must decide by when.",
        "segment": "25"
      }
    ]
  }
}
